post.description:
Run all preflight probes and return per-check verdicts.

Response payload shape:
    {
      "IsHealthy": bool,      # overall AND of probes
      "TotalProbes": int,
      "UnhealthyCount": int,
      "Probes": [
        {"Tier": str, "IsHealthy": bool, "Detail": str,
         "Remediation"?: str}
      ]
    }
